Final Output on Different Devices
Mobile (width < 600 px): A vertically scrollable ListView with 6 cards, each showing a phone icon and "Mobile Item 1–6".
Tablet (600–1023 px): A GridView with 2 columns displaying 6 cards labeled "Tablet Item 1–6".
Desktop (1024 px and above): A GridView with 4 columns displaying 8 larger cards labeled "Desktop Item 1–8".